From 1e81c85d973fa7ab1a9fa2daef06e32addba93f6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 17:43:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: media: document the Skyworth YK remote
 keymap

The Skyworth YK-series set-top-box remote decodes to NEC extended codes
that no map in the tree covers.

Name its keymap in the rc.yaml list so it can be selected from the
device tree, just like the other keymaps this file enumerates.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/rc.yaml
@@ -126,6 +126,7 @@ properties:
       - rc-real-audio-220-32-keys
       - rc-reddo
       - rc-siemens-gigaset-rc20
+      - rc-skyworth-yk
       - rc-snapstream-firefly
       - rc-streamzap
       - rc-su3000
